      "text": [
        "4409 - وَ قَالَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: \"يُكْرَهُ اَلْجَنَابَةُ حِينَ تَصْفَرُّ اَلشَّمْسُ وَ حِينَ تَطْلُعُ وَ هِيَ صَفْرَاءُ \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4409 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as), said: \"It is disliked to engage in janabah (ritual impurity due to sexual intercourse) when the sun is turning yellow and when it rises while it is yellow.\""
        ]
      }
